---
title: Spinach Dip
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Appetizers & Dips
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@frozen chopped spinach{1%pkg}
@Knorr's Veg Dry Soup Mix{1%pkg}
@mayonnaise{1%c}
@water chestnut{1%can} (finely chopped)
@sour cream{1%c}
@finely chopped grn onions{2%bunches}

Mix all ingredients and refrigerate.
